# heimdallr starter Suricata signatures. Replace these with real detections as
# scenarios land. Keep sids in the local range (>= 9000000).

# A deliberately loud smoke signature: fires on any packet, so the M1 benign
# pcap produces an alert that flows end to end to the dashboard. Disable it once
# the range is proven.
alert ip any any -> any any (msg:"heimdallr smoke: packet seen"; sid:9000001; rev:1;)
